2 featurettes on the making of this groundbreaking production\n* Director\u2019s commentary by Robert Rodriguez and co-writer Racer Max\n* Chapter selection to demo favorite moments for friends\n* Virtual \u201cSurreal Theater\u201d environment\n* A rocking spatial audio mix\n* Subtitles in English, Spanish, German, Korean, Japanese, and Chinese", "short_description": "Enter a new world of storytelling in this blockbuster \u201cimmersive cinema\u201d experience from visionary filmmaker Robert Rodriguez (Sin City). As a rogue agent with a mysterious past, you enlist the help of enhanced super-assassin M-13 (Michelle Rodriguez) to retrieve your identity and strike against the deadly organization that created you."}]}, "developer_name": "STXsurreal", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://stxentertainment.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://stxentertainment.com/terms", "publisher_name": "STXsurreal", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.thelimitvr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "FIGHTING", "MOVIE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "244566881194633"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_1087548584747440_3604119276702662656_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KWbJxUnDopIQ7kNvwGsHH_N&_nc_oc=AdlObORwNxOKrToJeK3XhKLXyCsp05R_Ih61P9IBOzxtmPU4zZy9xiPHh2X1I_Xpjzc&_nc_zt